%% Partial to-be amendment only; all other policy questions remain OPEN.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Acquire_NoWaiters
    Acquire_NoWaiters --> Acquire_WaitersPending: feasible but cannot admit
    Acquire_WaitersPending --> Acquire_NoWaiters: final waiter canceled or granted
    %% DR-001: valid head cancellation notifies the newly eligible zero prefix.
    Acquire_WaitersPending --> Acquire_NoWaiters: DR-001 cancel head, grant zero-only tail
    Acquire_WaitersPending --> Acquire_WaitersPending: DR-001 grant zero prefix, positive tail remains blocked
    Acquire_EligibleHeadPending --> Acquire_WaitersPending: notification reaches blocked tail or removal exposes it
    Acquire_EligibleHeadPending --> Acquire_NoWaiters: later release grants last or last canceled
    state "One Acquire call (orthogonal to instance)" as Invocation {
      [*] --> Acquire_Entering
      Acquire_Entering --> Acquire_Failed: Done detected under mutex
      Acquire_Entering --> Acquire_Succeeded: immediate charge
      Acquire_Entering --> Acquire_OversizedWaiting: too large and unlock
      Acquire_OversizedWaiting --> Acquire_Failed: context closes
      Acquire_Entering --> Acquire_Queued: create private ready and enqueue
      Acquire_Queued --> Acquire_Failed: canceled and unlinked
      Acquire_Queued --> Acquire_Granted: reserve unlink and close ready
      Acquire_Granted --> Acquire_Succeeded: observes Ready and no Done
      Acquire_Granted --> Acquire_Failed: observes Done and returns weight
    }
    state "Aggregate weight classification" as Counter {
      [*] --> WeightWithinCapacity
      WeightWithinCapacity --> WeightOutsideCapacity: unchecked signed weight or recovered over-release
      WeightOutsideCapacity --> WeightWithinCapacity: later arithmetic
    }
